   "variant": "exam-tip",
   "label": "Exam Hint",
   "md": "- Most calculators used at A-Level can handle complex numbers.\n- Once you have found the square roots algebraically; use your calculator to square them and make sure you get the number you were originally trying to square-root!"
  }
